703	/* ─────────────────────────── Table operations (DDL) ──────────────────────────
704	 * truncate / drop / rename / optimize / analyze / add-column / drop-column /
705	 * add-index / drop-index. Every one: owner-or-admin, not-impersonating, owned-db,
706	 * rate-limited, TABLE validated by membership. New object names go through
707	 * isSimpleIdent; a new column's type through normalizeColumnType; existing
708	 * columns/indexes through membership against the live structure. No user VALUES
709	 * are ever embedded (there are none in this DDL), and everything runs through the
710	 * scoped `runScopedSql` transport — the MySQL grant remains the hard boundary. */
